WEBVTT

00:07:29.556 --> 00:07:32.116
would only cost five cents more.

00:07:33.876 --> 00:07:35.356
So for me,

00:07:35.396 --> 00:07:39.356
the argument around affordability
is just a bad excuse

00:07:39.356 --> 00:07:43.756
for not making the necessary
decisions and investments.

00:07:43.916 --> 00:07:50.916
(Applause)

00:07:50.956 --> 00:07:53.836
And if we had a price on CO2,

00:07:53.836 --> 00:07:56.276
let's say around 150 dollars,

00:07:56.276 --> 00:07:59.396
the affordability argument
would disappear.

00:07:59.436 --> 00:08:03.276
I urge governments to show leadership